Product Requirements Document (PRD)
Project Name: Modern MERN E-commerce Platform
1. 📌 Product Overview

This project aims to build a modern, scalable, production-ready E-commerce web application using the MERN stack with Next.js (App Router) and TypeScript.

The platform will provide:

High-performance storefront

Secure authentication system

Dynamic product & category management

Real-time cart and order system

Role-based Admin Panel

Fully responsive and SEO-optimized UI

The goal is to achieve SaaS-level architecture quality with reusable components and clean code standards.

